OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Orkney Ba sold at auction
OL,4,Afor more than #3,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA handcrafted leather ball used in a
OL,7,Ftraditional mass street game in Orkney
OL,8,F119 years ago has sold for more than
OL,9,F#3,000.
OL,11,FThe Kirkwall Youths Ba was won by
OL,12,Fislander Pat Gunn on Christmas Day
OL,13,F1907.
OL,15,FThe game of Ba is believed to date back
OL,16,Fto medieval times and involves two
OL,17,Frival teams - the Uppies and the
OL,18,FDoonies - battling to get a ball to
OL,19,Fgoals at opposite ends of Kirkwall.
